Subject: [PATCH 06/39] feat: bilingual WhatsApp template (EN + ZH) per
 campaign
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- DB: add whatsapp_template_zh column
- campaignEditor: include whatsapp_template_zh in all three places
- Campaigns Edit form: side-by-side EN / 中文 template textareas
- WA popup: 🇬🇧 EN / 🇨🇳 中文 toggle buttons; defaults to ZH if set, else EN; active lang highlighted; message still editable before sending

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DqGp4gVeTBMvwho4pP8n8C
